     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Camping",
     "texto": [
      "**Berkemah** means to camp; **tenda** is a tent. During a camping trip you can set up the tent, look for tracks and make a campfire."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing the uniform",
     "texto": [
      "**Ikat pinggang berlogokan tunas kelapa** means that the belt has a coconut palm shoot logo. In English this relation is expressed with \"to have\"; in Indonesian, here it appears as ber-kan."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
